Z||000000||Haze_Performance||09-26-2001||04:50 AM||||Well, I've wanted a '95 Mustang Cobra (Cobra R project) for quite some time now. (It's now the season to buy) I love Fiero's but I don't have the room for more projects... I was just wondering what some might think my '85 Sport Coupe is worth? I have an idea, but I might be a little high. (Please be kind) <P>Heres a little info:<P>FACTORY STUFF<BR>61,000 miles -2.5L 4 Cylinder Engine - Auto Trans - Power Windows - Power Locks - A/C - Tilt - Cruise Control - Factory Sunroof<P>INTERIOR MODS<BR>-Custom Black Interior<BR>-7 pc. Polished Stainless Steel Dash inlays<BR>-Custom Leather Shifter Handle <BR>-Fiero Store Radio Pod Tray<BR>-Fiero Store Dash Mounted Glovebox <BR>-Fiero Store Black Logo Floormats<BR>-Fiero Store White Face Gauges<BR>-Grant Polished Steering Wheel & Kit<BR>-ODB Chrome Pedals with Deadpedal <BR>-Sony AM/FM CD Player with remote<BR>-Rockford Fosgate Punch 200ix Amp.<BR>-Rockford Fosgate 10" 1000Watt Subwoofer<BR>-Tinted Windows<BR>-Oreif's GT Door Tabs <BR>-Viper Alarm System (remote door & trunk)<BR>-New Carpet<BR>-New Black Headliner<P>EXTERIOR MODS<BR>-Rodney Dickman's "Pontiac" Windshield Banner<BR>-Rodney Dickman's "Fiero" Spare Tire Cover<BR>-Paul McKibben's "Pontiac Racing" Sail Panels<BR>-FOCOA Side Ram Air Scoops<BR>-LeBra Front End Cover<BR>-Custom Mirror Covers<BR>-Rear Sequential Turn Signals <P>SUSPENSION MODS<BR>-Eibach Pro-Kit Lowering Springs <BR>-New Shocks/Struts<BR>-17" x 7" MB Motors Alum. Wheels with 215-40 ZR17 Tires<BR>-Crossdrilled Rotors, Bearings & Stainless Lines<P>DRIVETRAIN MODS<BR>-Upgraded Charging System<BR>-Custom Dual Exhaust System<BR>-8.8 Accel Plug Wires<BR>-New Motor & Trans Mounts (Thanks to Oreif   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> )<BR>-New Dogbone<BR>--------------------------------------------------<P>CAR INFO<BR>I purchased this car in Feb. 2000. It had 38,000 orig. miles on it & was 100% stock. I did all the work on the car.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FronthouseDside2_1.jpg">  <BR>(Holley Scoop is gone. I have the FOCOA Scoops now)<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My85Wheels.jpg">  <BR>(Before Brake Upgrade)<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PumpkinPatch852.jpg">  <P><BR>Thanks<BR>-Haze <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallindysig_copy.jpg">      .      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smallredsig.jpg">      .      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fullstaff_1.gif">  <BR><I><B><FONT COLOR="red">Classic Fiero Owners</B></I></FONT> - <FONT COLOR="red"><A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 09-26-2001).]||||reg||9
